    md_dl_trace:'Download Seat Order & Division CSV',md_dl_last:'Download Last Seat CSV',
    md_last_intro:'Districts are sorted from the tightest race for the last seat, meaning the fewest extra votes the closest challenger would need. Click a district to see its seat order and division table.',
    md_sim_intro:'Move the threshold from 0 to 10 percent to see how each party\'s seats change. The calculation uses the same data and districts; only the threshold changes.',
    md_sim_label:'Threshold',md_sim_x:'Parliamentary threshold',md_sim_y:'Seats',md_sim_at:'Seats at {t}%',md_sim_change:'Change',
    md_sim_summary:'At a {t}% threshold, {n} parties pass. Votes for parties that do not pass total {v} ({pct}% of valid votes) and are not converted into seats.',
    md_tie_warn:'<strong>Note: the last seat is decided by a tie in {n} district-method combination(s).</strong> The calculator awards it by the order of parties in the data, while KPU Regulation 6/2024 Article 13(3) gives the seat to the party whose votes are spread across a wider area, assessed level by level. Review these seats before using the result:',
    md_btn_preset:'DPR 2024 preset (84 districts)',md_preset_loaded:'DPR RI 2024 data loaded: 84 districts, 18 parties, 580 seats. Ready to calculate.',
    md_preset_note:'<strong>Data source:</strong> valid votes of 18 parties in the 84 DPR RI 2024 electoral districts from Annex II of KPU Decree No. 360 of 2024, totalling 151,796,631 votes, with district magnitudes per KPU Decree No. 1206 of 2024. <strong>Validation:</strong> using Sainte-Laguë and a 4% threshold, this calculator reproduces the official seat allocation exactly in all 84 districts (PDI-P 110, Golkar 102, Gerindra 86, NasDem 69, PKB 68, PKS 53, PAN 48, Demokrat 44).',
    idx_preset_note:'<strong>Data source:</strong> valid votes of 18 parties and official DPR RI 2024 seat allocation per KPU Decree No. 1205 of 2024 (25 August 2024). The resulting indices describe the actual disproportionality of the 2024 DPR RI election.',
